## Installation

{% if project.project_type == "python" and project.pypi %}
```sh
pip install {{ project.pypi }}
```

Or with [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/):

```sh
uv tool install {{ project.pypi }}
```
{% elif project.project_type == "node" and project.npm %}
```sh
npm install {{ project.npm }}
```
{% elif project.project_type == "rust" and project.crate %}
```sh
cargo install {{ project.crate }}
```
{% elif project.project_type == "go" and project.go_module %}
```sh
go install {{ project.go_module }}@latest
```
{% elif project.project_type == "dotnet" and project.nuget %}
```sh
dotnet tool install --global {{ project.nuget }}
```
